/* Whitney proposes a bet on the size of the next fish caught, winner gets to have sex with PC */
:: Fishing Whitney Pier Bet
<<effects>>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingPier.whitney.phase to "bet">>
<<set $fishing.whitney.betFails to 0>>
<<set $weekly.fishing.whitneyBet to true>>

One of Whitney's friends tosses their rod aside and lets out a long, theatrical groan. "I'm bored." Whitney glances over at you, then back at <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends. "Yeah?" <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> tips back <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> cider. "I know what'll fix that."
<br><br>

<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> stands, rolling <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> shoulders. "Alright. New game." <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> steps towards you, close enough that you can smell the alcohol on <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> breath. "Next fish you pull up, if it's a big one, I get to have some fun with you." A grin spreads across <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> face. "Small one, one of them gets the prize instead," <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> says, jerking <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> thumb at one of <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends.
<br><br>

<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> tilts <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> head back at you. "What do you think, slut?" You're pretty sure it doesn't matter what you think.
<br><br>

<<link [[Accept|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><<npcincr Whitney dom 1>><</link>><<gdom>>
<br>
<<if $whitneyromance>>
	<<link [[Decline|Fishing Whitney Decline Game No Fight]]>><<npcincr Whitney dom -1>><</link>><<ldom>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Decline|Fishing Whitney Decline Game]]>><<npcincr Whitney dom -1>><</link>><<ldom>>
<</if>>


/* PC caught a big fish but tries to lie and claim it's small */
:: Fishing Whitney Pier Bet Lie Big
<<effects>>
<<if $englishSuccess is 1>>
	You hold the fish up, turning it in the light.
	<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
		"I'm... not sure this counts? It looks a bit small..."
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
		"Sorry, I don't see what's impressive about that." You tilt the fish. "That's not big."
	<<else>>
		"I don't know, this one looks kind of small to me."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	Whitney's eyes narrow. <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> leans in, studying the fish. A long pause.
	<br><br>

	"Hm." <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> steps back and jerks <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> chin at <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends. <span class="green">"Alright, go on then."</span>
	<br><br>

	<<loadNPC 1 "fishing_date_friend1">><<person2>>
	The <<person>> perks up immediately, grinning like <<he>> wasn't expecting to win.
	<br><br>

	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 3)>>
		<<link [[Comply reluctantly|Fishing Whitney Pier Friend Won Sex]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Comply reluctantly|Fishing Whitney Pier Friend Won Sex]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<stress 6>><<trauma 6>><</link>><<gstress>><<gtrauma>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 4)>>
		<<link [[Comply eagerly|Fishing Whitney Pier Friend Won Sex]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>><<promiscuous4>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Refuse|Fishing Whitney Pier Friend Won Resist]]>><</link>>

<<else>>
	<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
		"I'm... not sure it counts? It looks kind of small..." <span class="red"> Your voice trails off under Whitney's stare.</span>
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
		"Please. That's barely a fish." <span class="red">But your delivery lands flat, </span>and you know it.
	<<else>>
		"I don't know, this one looks kind of small to me." <span class="red">Your words don't come out as convincing as you'd like.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	Whitney stares at you. "Are you serious right now." It's not a question. <<npcincr Whitney love -2>><<llove>>
	<br><br>
	
	<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> takes the fish from your hand, holds it up, and looks back at you with flat contempt. "Get over here."
	<br><br>

	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 3)>>
		<<link [[Comply reluctantly|Fishing Whitney Pier Won Sex]]>><<npc Whitney>><<person1>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Comply reluctantly|Fishing Whitney Pier Won Sex]]>><<npc Whitney>><<person1>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<stress 6>><<trauma 6>><</link>><<gstress>><<gtrauma>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 4)>>
		<<link [[Comply eagerly|Fishing Whitney Pier Won Sex]]>><<npc Whitney>><<person1>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>><<promiscuous4>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Refuse|Fishing Whitney Pier Won Resist]]>><<npcincr Whitney dom -1>><<gdom>><</link>>
<</if>>



